  "Text": "Besedilo",
  "That backup is empty.": "Ta varnostna kopija je prazna.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Ta varnostna kopija je v zapisu {version}, ki ga ta gradnja ne zna prebrati.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "To ni videti kot URL. Prilepi povezavo do dodatka ali takšno, ki se začne s https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Ta datoteka ni JSON, torej ni varnostna kopija.",
  "That isn't a Ventic backup.": "To ni varnostna kopija Ventica.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Te slike ni bilo mogoče shraniti. Poskusi manjšo ali JPEG oziroma PNG.",
  "That source is already in the list.": "Ta vir je že na seznamu.",
  "That torrent holds no video file.": "Ta torrent ne vsebuje nobene videodatoteke.",
  "That's everything.": "To je vse.",
  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Povezava s torrentnim pogonom je sredi pretoka odpadla.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Prenosa ni bilo mogoče začeti.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Prenos se ni dokončal.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Povezava, ki jo je dal ta vir, je vrnila HTTP {status}. Morda je potekla — znova poišči po virih za svežo.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Do povezave, ki jo je vrnil ta vir, ni bilo mogoče priti.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Slika, ki je trenutno za aplikacijo",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Območje predvajalnika ni nikoli dobilo velikosti, zato se predvajanje ni začelo.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Predvajalnik sam — dekodiranje, podnapisi in zvok. GPLv2 ali novejša.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Projekt nobenega vira ne gosti, ne upravlja, ne podpira in ne priporoča ter ne razširja njihovega seznama.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Projekt na GitHubu",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Izdaja za to platformo ne vsebuje posodobitve.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Vir je to že pridobil — predvaja se takoj in na tej napravi ne pusti ničesar",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Seznama podpornikov ni bilo mogoče naložiti — aktualnega najdeš na strani Ko-fi zgoraj.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Torrentni pogon je magnet sprejel, a mu ni dodelil oznake.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Torrentni pogon, vgrajen v aplikacijo. Licenca MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Torrentni tok še ni pripravljen (pogon je vrnil HTTP {status}). Morda še pridobiva metapodatke od soležnikov.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Posodobitve ni bilo mogoče namestiti: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Tu je komaj prostor za en film. V predvajalnik priključi disk USB — formatiran kot FAT32, ki ga sprejme vsak Androidov predvajalnik — in prikazal se bo zgoraj, da boš prenašal nanj.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Ni računa, v katerega bi se prijavil, in nič se ne usklajuje s strežnikom. Kaj gledaš, kako daleč si prišel, tvoji priljubljeni in tvoj seznam za ogled — vse se hrani na tej napravi in je nikoli ne zapusti. Usklajevanje med zasloni je načrtovano; do takrat je varnostna kopija spodaj način, kako se knjižnica preseli.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "V tvoji mapi dokumentov ni datoteke {file}. Skopiraj eno tja in poskusi znova.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Ta povezava je trenutno merjena.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Ta povezava trenutno ni merjena.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Te kopije ni namestil Venticov namestitveni program — ampak upravitelj paketov ali gradnja iz izvorne kode — zato jo posodablja tisto, kar jo je tja postavilo. Zamenjava datotek od tu bi ga samo zmedla.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Dekodirnik te naprave je pri tej datoteki obupal. Običajno je kriv zvok: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) in DTS nista licencirana v sistemskem spletnem pogledu, zato se izdaja s takim zvokom predvaja kot slika brez zvoka ali pa sploh ne. Izdaja x264 z zvokom AAC se bo predvajala.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Ta datoteka ima eno zvočno sled.",
  "Timing": "Časovna uskladitev",
  "Tint": "Odtenek",
  "Title": "Naslov",
  "Too big for the download drive": "Prevelik za disk s prenosi",
  "Top rated": "Najbolje ocenjeno",
  "Torrent engine offline.": "Torrentni pogon ni povezan.",
  "Torrent engine said {status}.": "Torrentni pogon je vrnil {status}.",
  "Torrent engine said {status}: {reason}": "Torrentni pogon je vrnil {status}: {reason}",
  "Torrents": "Torrenti",
