  "Trailer": "Napovednik",
  "Transfers": "Prenosi v teku",
  "Trending": "V trendu",
  "Try again": "Poskusi znova",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Izklopi učinke, ki so za risanje najdražji: motno zabrisanost za stransko vrstico in meniji, zabrisanost grafike ozadja ter prelive in drsenja, ki se predvajajo, ko se stvari pojavijo ali dobijo fokus. Vse ostane, kjer je bilo, in nič se ne skrije — samo neha se premikati in postane ostro. Nalagalni krogci se še naprej vrtijo.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Za iskanje filmov in serij tipkaj v iskalno polje.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Vklopi zvok (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Neberljivo",
  "Untitled": "Brez naslova",
  "Upcoming": "Prihaja",
  "Update now": "Posodobi zdaj",
  "Updates": "Posodobitve",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Posodobitve se preverjajo v nameščeni aplikaciji, ne tukaj.",
  "Upload": "Pošiljanje",
  "Use default": "Uporabi privzeto",
  "Use this colour": "Uporabi to barvo",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Ventic vir prosi za {movie} ali {series} in pričakuje nazaj polje {streams}. Dodaj jih več in njihovi rezultati se združijo, dvojniki odpadejo, prej dodani viri pa imajo prednost.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Ventic prenese nov paket, Android pa te prosi, da potrdiš namestitev. Podpisan je z istim ključem kot tvoja kopija, zato se posodobi na mestu in ohrani tvojo knjižnico.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Ventic nima nastavljenega nobenega vira, zato ni kje iskati. Še vedno pa lahko predvajaš magnet ali torrent, ki ga odpreš sam.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic ne gosti vsebine, je ne indeksira in je dostavljen brez nastavljenih virov. To je odjemalec BitTorrent s priključenim predvajalnikom: pridobi samo tisto, na kar ga usmeriš, s strežnikov, ki si jih dodal sam.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Ventic je pod licenco MIT. Sestavni deli, na katerih je zgrajen, ohranijo svoje pogoje, navedene zgoraj; v Windowsih je priloženi mpv programska oprema pod GPL, njegova licenca in ponudba izvorne kode pa ležita ob izvršljivi datoteki aplikacije.",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Ventic je brezplačen, brez oglasov, brez računa in brez česar koli naprodaj. Podpisovanje, gostovanje in vzdrževanje stanejo — donacija pokrije prav to, v aplikaciji pa se ne spremeni nič, ne glede na to, ali jo daš ali ne.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Ventic je posodobljen.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Ventic hrani tvojo knjižnico na tej napravi. Za prenos na drug zaslon je spodaj datoteka varnostne kopije.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ventic sam po sebi ne išče ničesar. Vir je URL, ki ga dodaš tukaj in kaže na strežnik, ki odgovori s stvarmi za predvajanje. Kaj vir ponuja in ali imaš pravico to predvajati, je stvar med tabo in tistim, ki ga upravlja.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Ventic govori {protocol}. Tukaj deluje vsak URL dodatka Stremio — prilepi povezavo {link} ali naslov {manifest} in skrajšan bo na tisto, kar je potrebno.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ventic mu bo poslal naslov, ki ga iščeš, in predvajal to, kar vrne. Dodajaj samo strežnike, ki jim zaupaš — tega ta aplikacija ne upravlja in ne preverja.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Izšel je Ventic {version}",
  "Version {version}": "Različica {version}",
