  "Your own TMDB read token": "Tvoj lastni bralni žeton TMDB",
  "Your sources have nothing for this title.": "Tvoji viri za ta naslov nimajo ničesar.",
  "Your watch history, favourites, watchlist, sources and every preference here, written to a single {file}. Carry it to another device and restore it there, or keep one against the day this one is wiped.": "Tvoja zgodovina ogledov, priljubljeni, seznam za ogled, viri in vsaka nastavitev od tukaj, zapisani v eno samo {file}. Odnesi jo na drugo napravo in jo obnovi tam ali pa jo shrani za dan, ko bo ta naprava izbrisana.",
  "direct link": "neposredna povezava",
